  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Winter Necessities for Taiwanese Children</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is the 11th year Bright Side Projects is providing necessities and plant-based food staples pack to families and youth in need by working with local community centers, elementary schools, and the church. Packages will be distributed to 10 indigenous Atayal families in Hsinchu ChingChuan and 10 indigenous Amis families in Taitung, provide meals to children in orphanages, while over 600lbs of organic locally grown rice will be distributed to even more families in need.</narrative>
  </description>
